5,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us approach this selection with wisdom and a spirit of generosity toward the future. I look forward to our deliberation on these promising ventures.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"Thank you, Servas. I believe a disciplined approach is necessary here. We should ensure our decision is based on empirical evidence rather than optimistic narratives. I look forward to the analysis.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree with Asuka. A calm, evidence-based approach is the only way to ensure we make a sustainable choice. I look forward to seeing what the data reveals about our current position and the candidates.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to be part of this! Let's find a company that's not just amazing, but one that we can actually support and help grow. I can't wait to get started!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree. To ensure we make a grounded decision, we must look beyond the proposals. I believe we should start by examining the actual delivery records of our current holdings to identify recurring patterns.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,Wisdom teaches us that the strength of a tree lies in its roots. I believe we must understand how a new addition affects our internal harmony and reporting before we commit.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I agree. To avoid the pitfalls of narrative drift, I want to examine the account retention through price rises and the independent checks on holdings' reported figures. We need to know who actually kept their customers.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I believe we must be realistic about our financial commitments. I will examine the reserve accounts and follow-on calls, as well as the terms of last winter's credit line, to understand our actual liquidity and borrowing capacity.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,I want to make sure we have the right people to help these companies! I'll look into the retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench and partner board seats to see who's available!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I believe we must understand the friction points that delay deployment. I shall examine the delivery records of two holdings and the security review time before first deployment to see where timelines typically fracture.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It is a joy to see such diverse and thoughtful priorities. To ensure our reporting remains clear and our closing process peaceful, I shall examine the appraisal needs at the last audit and the independent checks on holdings' reported figures.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I believe we have a comprehensive set of inquiries. I am satisfied with my choices and will wait to see if the data confirms my suspicions regarding customer retention and reporting accuracy.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,I am also satisfied with my selections. Understanding our financial reserves and credit terms is essential for a responsible investment. I will proceed with these investigations.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'm all set too! I really hope I can find out if we have enough hands on deck to help the new company succeed. I'm super curious to see what's in the records!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I concur. By analyzing the gap between planning and actual deployment, we can better anticipate the risks we are assuming. I am ready to review the findings.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,"May we all find the clarity we seek in these records. I wish you each a productive investigation, and I look forward to the wisdom we shall gather together. Until we reconvene.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I agree. Let us hope the data provides a sobering reality check to the narratives we have been following. I am ready to proceed.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minako,,I am ready as well. Let us see if the financial records reflect a stable foundation for this next investment. I look forward to our next discussion.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm ready too! I'll do my absolute best to find the info we need. See you all in the next round! Bye for now!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Let us see if the records reveal the true nature of the obstacles we face. I am ready to proceed.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
