75,3,4,talk,Servas,,"It has been a privilege to deliberate with you all. In this unity, we have found a path that honors both the vision of the venture and the reality of our partners. I am at peace with our decision.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Asuka,,"I am satisfied with this outcome. By prioritizing empirical verification over optimistic narratives, we have selected a candidate that ensures both transparency and stability for the fund. Farewell.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Minako,,"I am also satisfied. By grounding our decision in financial realism and asset stability, we have protected the fund's future. It was a pleasure working with you all. Farewell.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Mio,,"This was so much fun! I'm really glad we found a company that fits our team perfectly and lets everyone do their best work. Thanks for being so great, everyone! Bye-bye!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Toshio,,"I am satisfied. We have successfully identified the candidate that minimizes external friction and systemic risk. By choosing Fabric Loop, we ensure that the path to first revenue is not blocked by the obstacles that have hindered us in the past. Farewell.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
